## Tool Name: run_getnpusers
### Description: Run Impacket's GetNPUsers.py to list and get TGTs for users vulnerable to AS-REP roasting (that have pre-authentication disabled).
For those users with such configuration, an output file will be generated so you can send it for cracking.
If 'usersfile' is omitted, the script will automatically attempt to identify user accounts with pre-authentication disabled via LDAP using the provided credentials. If no 'usersfile' and credentials are provided, it will attempt to retrieve users through an RPC null session.
**Args Schema:** ```{'additionalProperties': False, 'properties': {'domain': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Target domain (e.g., 'corp.local')."}, 'username': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Username for authenticated bind (optional).'}, 'password': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Password for authentication (optional).'}, 'usersfile': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Path to file containing a list of usernames to test (optional). One username per line must be specified (just the username, no domain needed).'}, 'dc_ip': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': "Domain controller IP address (recommended). If omitted, the positional argument's domain part will be used (in that case, it must be a Fully-Qualified-Domain-Name (FQDN))."}, 'extra_args': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Additional arguments for GetNPUsers.py.'}, 'timeout': {'default': 120, 'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Max execution time in seconds.'}}, 'required': ['domain'], 'type': 'object'}```

