**Args Schema:** ```{'additionalProperties': False, 'properties': {'target': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'The target IP address or hostname.'}, 'base_dn': {'type': 'string', 'description': "The base DN to search (e.g., 'DC=example,DC=com')."}, 'search_filter': {'default': '(objectClass=*)', 'type': 'string', 'description': "LDAP search filter to apply (default: '(objectClass=*)')."}, 'attributes': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': "Space-separated list of attributes to retrieve (e.g., 'cn mail memberOf')."}, 'bind_dn': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': "Bind DN for authentication (e.g., 'user@example.com' or 'CN=user,...'). If not provided, anonymous bind is attempted."}, 'password': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Password for authentication. If not provided and bind_dn is set, will prompt-less fail.'}, 'use_ssl': {'default': False, 'type': 'boolean', 'description': 'Whether to use LDAPS (True uses ldaps://).'}, 'port': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'integer'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Optional port override (e.g., 389 or 636).'}, 'extra_args': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Additional arguments for ldapsearch.'}, 'timeout': {'default': 120, 'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Maximum execution time in seconds.'}}, 'required': ['target', 'base_dn'], 'type': 'object'}```

## Tool Name: run_ldap_dump
### Description: Run ldapdomaindump against a domain controller with provided credentials.
Domain information dumper via LDAP. Dumps users/computers/groups and
OS/membership information to JSON output.
If either domain, username or password is not provided, it will attempt an anonymous dump (which may yield limited results depending on DC configuration).
**Args Schema:** ```{'additionalProperties': False, 'properties': {'hostname': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Hostname/ip or ldap://host:port connection string to connect to (use ldaps:// to use SSL)'}, 'domain': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'The target domain name (e.g. corp.local).'}, 'username': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'The username for authentication.'}, 'password': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'The password for authentication.'}, 'timeout': {'default': 300, 'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Maximum time in seconds that the command is allowed to run for (default is 300 seconds).'}}, 'required': ['hostname'], 'type': 'object'}```

## Tool Name: run_netexec
### Description: Run a netexec (nxc) command.
